  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Start with the cheeses, a mix of hard, semi-soft, soft and blue. Arrange them on the board in clusters rather than rows."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the charcuterie in clusters of its own, keeping the amount of meat close to the amount of cheese."
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill in around them with the crackers, breadsticks and bread, then the dip, olives, pickled vegetables, fresh fruit, and nuts and dried fruit."
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish with the honey or fruit preserves and the mustards."
    }
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Dips add variety and help stretch the portions. When the board is the main event, 150–200 g per person ensures guests leave satisfied. Arrange everything in clusters rather than rows for visual appeal."
  ],
